window.products.push({"id":179067,"name":"Saffron Marigold Starry Nights ~ Designer Blue Batik Contemporary Twin Bedspread 70x90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":100.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lz1cmq-8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Desert nights are chilly, but the resplendent sparkle of midnight stars enlivens the night and warms you to your toes. You'll be reminded of this vibrancy each time you see your bright blue and white batik bedspread unfurled across your bed. Authentic, bold, bohemian... it's the lifestyle you've always wanted, wrapped up in a soft cottony, star strewn spread.   The Twin bedspread is 70 inches wide and 90 inches long and is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely finished with neat double stitched hems  Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. About Starry Nights: Starry Nights draws its inspiration from the endlessly fascinating night sky. With its wondrous canopy of stars, the awe inspiring grandeur of the night sky has inspired poets, philosophers, and dreamers for centuries. Replete with moonlit indigo hued star-studded skies, the Starry Nights design is our attempt to capture the majestic beauty of the night skies. The border, with its dreamy floating cloud symbolism further enhances the night sky imagery. The Starry Nights range of furnishings is printed using only natural indigo dyes and employs the extremely laborious Double Dabu resist printing technique.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lz1cmq-8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B07C86HTGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C86HTGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C86HTGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
