window.products.push({"id":179299,"name":"SLEMOON Heavy Duty Kitchen Scissors Poultry Shears 2pcs set Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619960y8gSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL POULTRY SHEARS】The kitchen poultry shears are made of quality stainless steel, which makes it sharper and thicker. The blade of professional poultry shears has extreme sharpness, and one of the blades with a serrated edge is an ideal tool for scraping fish scales. It’s effortless for kitchen chicken shears heavy-duty to slice through chicken wing, fish, meat and vegetable, which made it a vital role in the kitchen. 【COMFORTABLE FISHBONE ERGONOMIC DESIGN HANDLE】The Fishbone ergonomic handles of the stainless steel kitchen scissors made by superior brass, which makes it comfortable and anti-slip. And the kitchen chicken scissors handle with great grip is suitable for both left and right hands users. The fishbone ergonomic design will offer your hand a more comfortable grip when you cut food ingredients. Eight reinforced rivets embedded in the handle deeply, which makes it be sturdy and firm. 【LOADED SPRINGS OF KITCHEN SCISSORS NO FALL APART】The stainless steel kitchen scissors along with built-in springs, it will relieve the pressure from your hand. The booster spring rebounds automatically, which is not easy to fall apart or break during the usage process. Just apply force in one direction with little effort. Also, the kitchen scissors heavy duty come with an open and close lock design, it’s more convenient to free adjust the professional kitchen meat scissors by yourself. 【NO NEED TO WORRY ABOUT KITCHEN SHEARS RUST OR DULL 】The professional stainless steel kitchen scissors are easy to sanitize and .wipe off the water and keep dry after each use to prevent rust and corrosion. The premium stainless steel kitchen scissors heavy duty are durable and sturdy, which will not dull even cut abundant chicken bones or meat. It’s obvious that the professional kitchen poultry shears are a must-have for your kitchen. 【MUCH SAFER & CONVENIENT KITCHEN SCISSORS】The stainless steel kitchen chicken scissors come with a safety lock design is much safer and more convenient during cutting chicken, meat, vegetable. And the kitchen poultry scissors save your time between switching the knife and other kitchen tools. The kitchen chicken scissors have great flexibility and operability. You will find the professional kitchen poultry scissors are more convenient and maneuverable than a knife or cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619960y8gSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLEMOON","source_asin":"B0BGLDPCXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLDPCXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLDPCXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
