window.products.push({"id":179358,"name":"Restaurant Salt and Pepper Shaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I2O4VEoCL._AC_.jpg","description":"\"Founded in 1946 by Adolf Davis, TableCraft Products Company opened its doors as an import distribution company serving the foodservice industry. By virtue of our simple mission to offer unmatched service and conscience-driven foodservice innovations, we've since grown significantly to offer well over 3,000 products. In businesses large and small, you'll find our products in the front-of-the-house, the back-of-the-house, in kitchens, and on tabletops. From beautiful and multi-functional buffet service collections to classic and contemporary tabletop products, we bring creative designs, elevated style and one-of-a-kind product versatility to foodservice customers around the world. Quality. Service. Innovation. Exclusive designs. Those are the reasons our customers choose TableCraft. Come and see for yourself.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I2O4VEoCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tablecraft","source_asin":"B0064N63QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064N63QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064N63QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179359,"name":"Homevibes 60\" Recessed Electric Fireplace Insert and Wall Mounted Electric Fireplace Heater 3.86\" Ultra Thin with Remote Control and Touch Screen 750W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ssPObGEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cold winter is coming, are you still looking for suitable heating appliances for your room? This latest version of the electric fireplace heater is your best choice. It has two installation methods: wall mounting and in-wall, a variety of optional flame colors, and 8 timing options. Besides, the temperature options are high and low, and they can be adjusted to your preference,  perfect for you to spend warm and cozy wintertime. Buy an electric fireplace, please choose us, it is worth buying. Features: 5 FLAME DIMMER: 5 settings(L1-L2-L3-L4-L5) flame dimmers from L1-L5, while L5 is the brightest setting. 8 TIMER SETTING: Press the time setting button until reach the desired setting(1h,2h,3h,4h,5h,6h,7h,8h). 5 FLAME SPEED: Control the flame speed with 5 settings from V1 to V5(V1, V2, V3, V4, V5), while V5 is the fastest setting. 2 HEATER SETTING: Control the heater setting with 2 settings, warm and hot. (-), heater blows warm air(750W);(--), heater blows hot air(1500W). Heater functions cycle from (OFF)(-)(--). SAFETY DESIGN: With an ETL certificate and it is safe enough for children and pets. Easy to install Dimensions: Overall Size: 60\"x18.11\"x3.86\"(LxHxW) In-wall Recessed Size: 54.75\"-59.2\" x 3.15\"-3.54\" x 16.93\"-17.7\" (LxHxW)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ssPObGEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homevibes","source_asin":"B08N6GPM8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N6GPM8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N6GPM8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
