window.products.push({"id":179361,"name":"HoneyJar Metal Shelby Cobra Embossed Magnet SVT Carroll Ford Mustang GT Refrigerator Fridge Tool Box Garage Sign Man CAVE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EXsxSaHLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HOW DO I USE IT? In order to get the best results, it is important that the following instructions are followed. 1. With cap on, shake well to mix paint. When you hear the ball rattle inside, you’ll know the paint is mixing. 2. Press the tip to release the air. Then press the tip several times vertically until the ink exudates. 3. Test on paper before use. Then enjoy painting on different surfaces. If the nib dries out, you can press it again. 4. Recommended to cover the pen cap in time when not in use to prevent it from drying out.Better protection of the tip to extend the service life. NOTE: 1. Different materials have different drying times and different coloring conditions. You can wait for a while after writing to ensure better drying.Let it dry for a day for permanent results. 2. For a permanent result on the glass, porcelain, and ceramics, projects should be baked. Suggest bake for 1 hour 350F(180C). 3. Sharp rubbing will cause loss of color, you can use the pen to make up for color again. 4. Pay attention to hand contact when writing.After staining,please clean your hands as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EXsxSaHLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baniful","source_asin":"B08CXNGFNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXNGFNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXNGFNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
