window.products.push({"id":179505,"name":"FANKUTOYS Family Birthday Reminder Calendar Board Wall Hanging, Wooden Unfinished DIY Birthday Tracker Plaque Board with 100 Pcs Round Heart Tags for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Ms6Bs98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature: Easy to use: Each wood chip has 2 pre-drilled holes, paired with assembly hooks, you can string them together freely. All you need to do is to schedule all the dates and events, and use twine to connect the wooden reminder calendar board for wall, they can be easily hung on the wall. Reminder tracker plaque board wall hanging: With this birthday board wall hanging for classroom, you can express love and care to your family and friends on an important day. Enough tags: As your family continues to grow, we provide 100 tags (50 circles tags and 50 heart tags) instead of 50 tags. 🎈How to use: 1- Simply write your friend or family member's name and special date on the round or heart tag. 2- Use the silver metal ring to completely connect them together. 3- Suspend the tags you completed in the corresponding month. -Specification: *Material: wood, durable hemp rope *Weight: about 237g / 8.36oz *Size: as shown Package Included: ●1 Family birthday reminder board ●1 x jute rope ●50 x heart-shaped wooden tags ●50 x round wooden disc ●100 x assembly hook ●12 x decorative bells Please Note: *The wooden circles and hearts are blank and untreated,so they are easy to write on or paint. * To avoid bleeding into wood making names blurry, It is better to use a gel based pen or a ultra-fine point Sharpie Marker. *If you did not receive accessories parts, please feel free to let us know, we promise to send you a new one .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Ms6Bs98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FANKUTOYS","source_asin":"B08SKD6L5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SKD6L5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SKD6L5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
