window.products.push({"id":179550,"name":"enuullao White Fringe Tassel Duvet Cover Set King Size with Tassel,3 Pieces 100% Washed Cotton Comforter Cover with Zipper Ties,1 Boho White Duver Cov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pOKBRUCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WASH COTTON:Made by High-quality material, it is skin-friendly, breathable, machine washable and never fade. Washed cotton is the raw material handled by special process. It is more comfortable than other materials. Soft and comfy sense of touch always gives you a sweet sleep and accompanies you through four seasons. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 3-piece set includes one king white duvet cover and two pillow shams. 1 tassel duvet cover measures 104\" x 90\" inches. 2 tassel pillow shams measure 20\" x 36\" inches. UNIQUE CRAFTSMANSHIP:Handcrafted tassel fringed, unique weaving technology. This white bedding set with tassel-trimmed edges, delicate, chic, elegant and decorative, give your room a minimal-boho look. EASY CARE:Machine wash with cold water, wash separately from dark item. Avoid the tassels fallen, please turn over the duvet cover and pillowcases, put them in the laundry bag and washing on the gentle setting. NOTE: 1.Not include comforter. 2Please allow 1-3cm difference due to manual measurement. 3.Please note that slight color difference should be acceptable due to the light and screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pOKBRUCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"enuullao","source_asin":"B0BDLJP9B2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDLJP9B2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDLJP9B2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179551,"name":"8 inches/20cm Wood Cake Dessert Rack , Round Cupcake Tray, Wedding Birthday Party Pedestal Display Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GkSKLvN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our classic cake tray is great, and when it's time for it, you can easily lay out your fresh baked goods and be ready for a stylish presentation on any occasion!You will become the envy of your guests at every party as you show off your baking skills on this beautiful cake plate. The height of the whole cake tray is 6.6 inches/16.5 cm, and the size of the bottom is 10 inches/25 cm. Can hold cakes under 7 inches. made of acacia wood by our craftsmen. This is a healthy old wedding cake rack. Made from natural wood, the finish gives this cake plate a vintage touch. Easy to clean; Wood cake plates can be washed with mild soap and cold water. We suggest that wood products do not soak and need to be thoroughly dried after washing. The elegantly crafted platter with the fitted dome cover keeps your food fresh . The clear cover displays and protects cake and other pastries. It's elegant style will enhance the beauty of any baked goods and the dome lid will keep them fresher, longer. You can easily pair this lid with various round plates or platters to protect and serve your favorite foods.Keep your confections fresh under the cover. Cakes, pies, pastries, even cheese does better when not exposed to drying air.An elegant yet modern way to display your culinary masterpieces, with this square cake stand plate .It is with quite excellent quality, looks very beautiful and elegant and rustic. Showcase your best kitchen creations with this amazing quality durable cake stand that is perfectly crafted to exude great style! Bake your favorites and put them on an elegant display for everyone to see. It is perfect for displaying small decorative treats like cupcakes, cheesecakes, cookies, brownies, and pastries! Perfect for serving appetizers to your guests at a dinner party, add an array of dips or appetizers to serve your friends and family! Widely used for bread, cake, and also can be a service tray, tea cup tray, bowl tray and much more. Perfect for home, restaurant, hotel, office,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GkSKLvN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BBrand","source_asin":"B08F3HVCBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F3HVCBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F3HVCBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
