window.products.push({"id":179556,"name":"WUBODTI Gray Blackout Curtains Drapes 63 Inch Length for Living Room Bedroom Nursery, Silver Foil Moon and Star Soundproof Window Curtains 2 Panel Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WRKQ3-YrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕🎁【Package Includes】Each package includes set of 2 silver printed stars and moon blackout curtains. Each galaxy room decor panel measures 52 inch wide x 63 inch long with durable anti-rust grommets (1.6 inch inner diameter). This star room decoration curtain is comparable with most rods, which make it easy to install and slide. ⭐🎁【Unique Design】The starry sky series window curtains with bright stars and moons spreading on a fantastic gray background, look aesthetic, romantic, cute and upmarket, vividly demonstrates a perfect visual effect. These cute gray drapes, compatible with any room decors, adds casual elegance,fun and romance for your home. 🌛🎁【Premium Quality】Our galaxy room decor curtain , made of 100% imported triple weaved light blocking polyester, are soft, silky, and durable. The thread trimmed and wrinkle-free panels maintains good light blocking, noise reducing or sound blocking, thermal insulating function, perfect for personal privacy, night shifts, late sleepers and afternoon naps etc. 🌝🎁【Extensive Use】With chemical and formaldehyde free fabric, our blackout curtains are perfect for kids bedroom, kids room decor for boys or girls, living room, nursery, dinning room, infant room and basement etc. These soundproof and noise canceling curtains admirably goes with any room decors and creates a quiet and safe environment for your beloved friends or family. 🌈🎁【Easy Care】Machine or hand wash is available for these stylish colorfast window drapes. The sturdy curtains are machine washable only in cold water, gentle cycle or dry clean. Tumble dry or naturally dry. Don't bleach. Iron on low heat if it’s needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WRKQ3-YrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WUBODTI","source_asin":"B07XYQFJ3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYQFJ3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYQFJ3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179557,"name":"EXP Antique Style 24-Inch Round Accent/End Table with Mahogany Finish, Carved Trim and Marble Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EOMeESMQL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Oriental round end table, handmade from wood and embellished with a decorative marble top will add Eastern elegance to any room in your home. Perfect for showing off your favorite lamp, a bouquet of flowers or anything else you can imagine on the decorative marble top. Below the marble surface is a handcrafted tier that supports the five classically shaped cabriole legs. This tier is carved in the shape of a blooming, five-sided flower and is perfect for showcasing your favorite ornamental vase or plant. Three softly layered beveled edges support the white, gray and black marble top. The intricate floral pattern around the table's top perimeter is a testament to the artisan's expert craftsmanship. This beautiful Chinese round end table is a perfect addition to any room in your home. Measures 24 inches high and 14 inches in diameter. AsiaEXP brings you authentic, handcrafted goods from a variety of world cultures. With this purchase, you are not only receiving a beautiful product, but you are supporting a great cause. Many Chinese craftsmen utilize their fine carpentry skills, passed down through generations over hundreds of years, as their main means of support. Your purchase enables native artisans to support families while pursuing their craft. This not only ensures the sustainability of the talented individuals making these fine products, but also helps to preserve the rich cultural heritage of China. The handcrafted nature of this product will produce minor differences in design and sizing. Subtle variations will occur from piece to piece, adding to the uniqueness of individual items. Measurements may vary slightly. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EOMeESMQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXP","source_asin":"B0015GYOCI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015GYOCI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015GYOCI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
