window.products.push({"id":179653,"name":"Top Split King Sheets Sets for Adjustable Beds - 100% Egyptian Cotton 4Pcs Bed Sheets Split Top King Sheets Flex Head King Sheets Sets Split Down 34 i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZvvfC9ZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPLIT HEAD KING SHEET SET SIZE: 1 Split Head Fitted Sheet (78 X 80 Inch) Split 34 inches from the top, 1 Flat Sheet (102 X 108 Inch) and 2 King Pillowcases (20 X 40-Inch) Only Pockets Fits Upto 15-18 Inch Deep Pocket Mattress. Keep In Mind That a “Split Head” or “Split Top Mattress” Should Never Be Confused With a “Split Bed Mattress”, Split Head or Split Top Mattresses are ONLY Split At The Top or Head Of The Mattress . CRAFTSMANSHIP: Meticulous craftsmanship and expertly woven from the finest long staple cotton yarns to produce super soft luxurious feel which are breathable and long-lasting. Special finishing process to accentuate the Lustre and softness the fabric. DIRECT FROM THE MANUFACTURERS - Woven from the finest Long Staple Cotton on a 300 Thread Count, with Bottom Fitted Sheet, that is FULLY ELASTICIZED to ensure a secure fit with Deep Pockets (up to 18 inch) to fit your mattresses. TOP QUALITY – The product is made with High Quality Fabric, hence they are fade, shrink and wrinkle resistant. They may shrink and wrinkle a bit as they are made from pure cotton. You will witness the sheet set getting softer and glowing with every wash. Customer Satisfaction is our prime goal and we take every feedback very seriosly. Having any issue with the product, contact us and we will make sure you get the best solution possible. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Our bedding collections require minimum wash care instructions. However to enjoy the sheet set at its best we suggest you not to use bleaching agents while washing. Use tumble dry. Avoid drying open at direct sun rays. Wash using gentle washing powders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZvvfC9ZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rajlinen","source_asin":"B086HR91X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HR91X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HR91X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179654,"name":"Travel by Air - Western Air Express - Glendale, California - Grand Central Air Terminal - Vintage Airline Travel Poster by Kerne Erickson - Master Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+f4CcgNGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Kerne Erickson - For over 30 years, award-winning artist Kerne Erickson’s retro-style travel posters have been taking viewers ‘on location’ to popular destinations around the globe. Inspired by vintage vacation photos, brochures and other graphics, his depictions are painstakingly researched and meticulously depicted for historical accuracy as well as irresistible nostalgia. At a time when sterile, computer-generated art has become popular, it’s refreshing to see an artist like Kerne who can work his way from a well composed pencil drawing, through transparent layers of under painting, building depth and tonality until finally adding the finishing touches that bring the work into focus. His work is a perfect blend of traditional technique and modern painting mediums. Erickson, a graduate of Los Angeles Art Center College, worked for years as a freelance graphic artist on client commissions which served to develop his distinctive style. He is now a freelance artist working at his home in Orange County, California where he lives with his family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+f4CcgNGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B01MPYMSIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MPYMSIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MPYMSIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
