window.products.push({"id":179690,"name":"Klean Kanteen Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XMUxUS2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Klean Kanteen Vacuum Insulated Tumbler 20oz is Klean Kanteen's best cup solution for hot coffee, cold brew, tea, beer, cocktails and water. The 20oz Insulated Tumbler will keep drinks hot for 6 hours and iced for 24. Long enough for coffee from your favorite coffee shop at work, and cool ice water during hot days by the pool. The splash resistant Tumbler Lid helps keeps drinks contained, is easy to drink from, clean and crafted from BPA-free polypropylene #5 and food-grade silicone. Tumbler is crafted from high quality, durable food grade 18/8 stainless steel with wide 3.08 inch (78mm) opening. Electropolished interior and rounded corners make the Vacuum Insulated Tumbler 20oz cup easy to clean and maintain. All Klean Kanteen products are made using safe healthy materials and backed by the Strong as Steel Guarantee. Hand washing recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XMUxUS2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klean Kanteen","source_asin":"B01FGC8L3E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FGC8L3E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FGC8L3E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179691,"name":"Degrees of Comfort [Upgraded Weighted Throw Blanket | Thick & Fuzzy Blanket Can Be Taken Anywhere Sleep with Pilling Proof, Durable, Soft Blanket Buil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAy95SqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: THE WEIGHTED BLANKET ready to calm the body and mind: Lack of sleep can wreak havoc causing irritable and unhappy life, directing to health problems. This blanket is made to fit adults and kids, th restless spourses, husband and wives. NANO-CERAMIC BEAD TECHNOLOGY â THE MOST ADVANCED weighted blanket filling on the planet! Say goodbye to cheap glass and plastic bead fillings that feel like a âquilt of cornhole bagsâ¦â and hello to silky serenity with our Nano-Ceramic Beads. This filling stays distributed throughout the entire blanket, while making you feel like youâre on a white sand beach REPEL PET HAIR â NOBODY CAN RESIST the comfortability and beauty of our faux fur throw blankets, even your pets! Donât worry, we thought ahead by constructing our soft blankets with antistatic materials. NOTE: This blanket is spot clean only. VERSATILE IN ANY SETTING: BEDS, SOFAS, VEHICLE SEATS â EVEN THE IN THE OUTDOORS our fuzzy throw blankets can thrive. We combined the same life changing sleep rejuvenation benefits our weighted blanket line, into a smaller more MULTIPURPOSE package. Now you can easily take our soft blanket anywhere, and gain restoring rest in any situation. NO SHRINKAGE, MATTING OR PILLING - GUARANTEED: While most throw blankets fall apart or wear out in just a few short weeks, forcing you to buy all over again, our durable, fluffy soft blankets are ENGINEERED from the STURDIEST MATERIALS with a DURALAST FIBER STITCHING - Enjoy our 365 Money Back Guarantee! Details: Created by YOU, for YOU Due to adult life stress, nervousness and agitation can be negative compounded by lack of sleep. This crippling exhaustion can affect loved ones all around resulting in short-temper, decrease work performance and ability to focus. Seeking solution using medication can cause unpleasant side effects. Restlessness in bed can also hamper partner's valuable sleep quality. Something must change. Like most people plagued with sensory issues, this drained existence from sleep deprivation can seem like a life sentence. A discovery of a natural method of nervousness alleviation. The practical, simple secret is weighted blankets. The heaviness stimulates calming chemicals, causing less twitch, feeling secure and allows the mind at ease. Relax Anywhere You Go After seeing life changing results of our larger weighted blankets, we decided to engineer a more versatile, smaller throw blanket design that can easily adapt to your comfort needs in ANY SETTING. Cozy Up and Fall Asleep in the car, on the couch, at night in your bed, outside by the campfire, on the plane ride home literally unwind anywhere! A Gift to Boost Those Brownie Points Many of our beloved customers have given our soft blankets as gifts for patients, anniversaries, bridal and baby showers and birthdays! Any occasion is the proper occasion to bless someone else with the sleep inducing power of weighted blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAy95SqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Degrees of Comfort","source_asin":"B08DCR88J2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DCR88J2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DCR88J2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
