window.products.push({"id":179794,"name":"Velvet Fabric Home Office Chair with Gold Metal Legs for Home Office Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W0bSS27zL._AC_.jpg","description":"This modern velvet chair with a gold metal base combines the beautiful and classic style. It is perfect for your home office, living room, bedroom, or any other decor theme; it can also be a makeup vanity chair for girls and women. Skin-friendly velvet seat and tufted back make this home office chair provide maximum comfort. Moreover, the warm color design could let you enjoy your time. By raising the lever under the seat, you can easily adjust the height of the home study desk chair from 31''-34.5 \", suitable for people of different heights; the best wide is 19.25\" and the depth is 19\". Lustrous gold metal trim on the base add modern glamour, Hooded caster wheels, and swivel capability for smooth 360-degree mobility, One-touch pneumatic height adjustment lever. Our chair is easy to assemble; each chair has a clear instruction paper in the box, it's easy to put together, you can finish it in about 15 minutes, and all the screws and tools are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W0bSS27zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mojay","source_asin":"B0BR4H83RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR4H83RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR4H83RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179795,"name":"Kaiser Bakeware La Forme Nonstick 13x18-Inch Jelly Roll Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B8VYPFYHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Presenting Kaiser's top-of-the-line LaForme bakeware. It's made of commercial-weight steel that allows gentle heat distribution for even browning and baking. A two-layer nonstick coating inside and out eliminates the need for flouring pans, resulting in baked goods that have a smooth crumb. Release is quick and easy and the Magnum coating won't be damaged by cutting in the pan. Pick one up as a shower gift or for any baking enthusiast. 13x18\". Amazon.com Jelly roll pans aren't just for jelly rolls anymore, and this hefty and versatile pan proves it: from toasting nuts to roasting potatoes or baking gooey baklava, this jelly roll pan accommodates breakfast, lunch, dinner, and dessert, and everything in between. Made by Kaiser, the largest bakeware manufacturer in Europe and the second largest in the world, the pan promises nothing less than perfection: the commercial-weight stainless steel ensures even heat distribution and efficient cooking--baked goods actually finish 10 to 15 minutes more quickly than recipe estimates. Another benefit of commercial-weight steel: it retains its shape and browns foods evenly. Pay special attention when carrying the pan to and from the oven since its 13-by-18-inch size and professional weight require two hands to balance and support, especially when laden with food. A two-layer nonstick coating on the inside and the outside of the pan make food removal and cleanup simple and easy. The rugged Magnum coating on the pan bottom allows cutting without damage to the surface, and is unaffected by acidic or citrus foods. Since nonstick surfaces require more care in use and cleaning, choose wooden or heat-resistant plastic to cook, and hand wash using liquid soap and a soft sponge. --Emily Wolf","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B8VYPFYHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaiser Bakeware","source_asin":"B00004RC42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RC42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RC42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":179796,"name":"Klear Vu Gripper Overstuffed Universal Non-Slip Dining Chair Cushions for Kitchen Decor or Office Use, U-Shaped Skid-Proof Seat Pad, 17x17 Inches, 2 C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hhBe28aFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn your dining chair into a lovely and comfy furniture with the Klear Vu Polar XL Dining Chair Cushions Set. The home and office seat pad measures 17\" inches L x 17\" inches W x 3\" inches H. Includes two seat pads only. The home and office chair pads are made of durable and comfortable 100% Polyester fabric. These seat cushions will make your dining chairs or any home or office chair furniture more comfortable and look more gorgeous, featuring a beautiful chenille textured fabric with button tufts. The back of the pad has the signature Gripper that keeps it in place even without ties. Overstuffed with our uniquely designed CloudFill for a fuller, thicker cushion that is truly comfortable. Perfect for your home, or use in the office. Trusted since 1960 Klear Vu has been the premier manufacturer of stylish and functional chair pads and rocker sets All products are made in the USA so you are ensured each piece is made from high quality materials and with top notch workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hhBe28aFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klear Vu","source_asin":"B086W7SPW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-179796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086W7SPW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086W7SPW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
